{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like gambling, right?</strong> Of course you do! As I've always said, there's no better way to invest your money than putting it all on red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balltopia</strong> is a roguelike marble racing simulator where your only objective is to make more money. Featuring dozens of unique levels and over 50 game-altering cards, the potential to win is almost limitless - but be careful! Place an errant bet, and you could lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide your risk. </strong>Along the way,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you'll discover synergistic card combos and strategies. Some will allow you to play it safe, and others will require you to risk everything - with the potential to win even bigger. Is it worth the gamble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong> Hop on in and get the ball rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003490?t=1759858083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003490?t=1759858083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/9f6a9d58808a2470604c66d46c27cf79cfe61bae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759858083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/9f6a9d58808a2470604c66d46c27cf79cfe61bae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759858083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like gambling, right?</strong> Of course you do! As I've always said, there's no better way to invest your money than putting it all on red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balltopia</strong> is a roguelike marble racing simulator where your only objective is to make more money. Featuring dozens of unique levels and over 50 game-altering cards, the potential to win is almost limitless - but be careful! Place an errant bet, and you could lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide your risk. </strong>Along the way,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you'll discover synergistic card combos and strategies. Some will allow you to play it safe, and others will require you to risk everything - with the potential to win even bigger. Is it worth the gamble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong> Hop on in and get the ball rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SwinklyDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/de9a0c0efe2af019eee59f80c56065d9ebf8e8ea/header.jpg?t=1759858083","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003490/453120411/a5cb98219efe62a0e1a0d7bcec96405cd10d5ff8/1759595322/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759595967","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003490/453120411/a5cb98219efe62a0e1a0d7bcec96405cd10d5ff8/1759595322/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759595967","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003490/453120411/a5cb98219efe62a0e1a0d7bcec96405cd10d5ff8/1759595322/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759595967","id":257204282,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204282/movie480.mp4?t=1759595967","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204282/movie_max.mp4?t=1759595967"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204282/854104c93